<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 10.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 10.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, June 10:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,664.70 (1,667.40)	CHF  1,158.40 (1,143.60)</p>
<p>    DEM    971.18 (959.38)	  GBP  2,722.60 (2,702.40)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.00 (136.33)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $30.26 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$18.30 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $48.56 million ($69.40 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
